      "text": "f(x, y) = x^2 + y^2\ninput = x = 3, y = 4\nf(3, 4) = 3^2 + 4^2\n         = 9 + 16 = 25",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "f(x, y) = x^2 + y^2\ninput = x = 3, y = 4\nf(3, 4) = 3^2 + 4^2\n         = 9 + 16 = 25",
