      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2c(x,y) = 2(5(2)^2 + 3(2)(3) + 4(3)^2 + 10(2) + 20(3) + 100) (10^6)\n2c(x,y) = 2(20 + 18 + 36 + 20 + 60 + 100) (10^6)\n          = 2(254) (10^6)\n          = 508 (10^6)",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2c(x,y) = 2(5(2)^2 + 3(2)(3) + 4(3)^2 + 10(2) + 20(3) + 100) (10^6)\n2c(x,y) = 2(20 + 18 + 36 + 20 + 60 + 100) (10^6)\n          = 2(254) (10^6)\n          = 508 (10^6)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
