    {
      "id": "hxtb3B8asASEO0p5p9a4D",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 132817.16103569488,
      "y": 32192.26720359426,
      "width": 1038.0604248046875,
      "height": 945,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b19",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1187521790,
      "version": 335,
      "versionNonce": 983204322,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1749477719300,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Diket:\n\nuntuk 1 unit\nx = 2\ny = 3\n\ndan fungainya\n\nc(x, y) = 5x^2 + 3xy + 4y^2 + 10x + 20y + 100\n\njawab:\n\nc(2, 3) = 5(2)^2 + 3(2)(3) + 4(3)^2 + 10(2) + 20(3) + 100\nc(2, 3) = 5(4) + 3(6) + 4(9) + 20 + 60 + 100\nc(2, 3) = 20 + 18 + 36 + 20 + 60 + 100\nc(2, 3) = 200 + 18 + 36\nc(2, 3) = 254\n\nharga 1 unit robot = 254 juta\n\njadi, 2 unit -> 254 * 2 = 508 juta",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Diket:\n\nuntuk 1 unit\nx = 2\ny = 3\n\ndan fungainya\n\nc(x, y) = 5x^2 + 3xy + 4y^2 + 10x + 20y + 100\n\njawab:\n\nc(2, 3) = 5(2)^2 + 3(2)(3) + 4(3)^2 + 10(2) + 20(3) + 100\nc(2, 3) = 5(4) + 3(6) + 4(9) + 20 + 60 + 100\nc(2, 3) = 20 + 18 + 36 + 20 + 60 + 100\nc(2, 3) = 200 + 18 + 36\nc(2, 3) = 254\n\nharga 1 unit robot = 254 juta\n\njadi, 2 unit -> 254 * 2 = 508 juta",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
